tend to fall into like a couple of categories&nbsp;
or patterns one of them can be hope for living&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:12.000
and then another category I think is like&nbsp;
there's beauty in the struggle like themes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.260
