specific themes for particular movies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:22.980
most often I look to the characters transformation&nbsp;
or the lesson that they learn to understand what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:30.360
the theme is in Goodwill Hunting it's been a&nbsp;
while since I saw that movie but I guess let's&nbsp;&nbsp;

