this story that he's not doing himself or anyone&nbsp;
else any favors by not living up to his potential&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:08.040
again it's been a while since I saw the movie so&nbsp;
hopefully that's accurate but I would say that&nbsp;&nbsp;

