00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:27.240
point where he's going to finally understand what&nbsp;
he needs to learn from this whole this whole mess&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:33.960
so act two forces the the plot events and&nbsp;
the experiences that the character has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:42.960
forces him closer to understanding the lesson that&nbsp;
thematic lesson and then in act three that's where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:49.320
we get to see the character embrace this lesson&nbsp;
or not in most movies that we watch that have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:56.160
transformed characters and happier endings&nbsp;
usually they accept the lesson and embrace it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.160 --> 00:06:02.280
and incorporate it into the way they approach the&nbsp;
