00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:10.140
resolve how does character lead to plot oh well&nbsp;
I think you can you can use character to lead&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:18.420
you to figure out plot by related to character&nbsp;
arc so understanding what lesson your character&nbsp;&nbsp;

